  "1952301977": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1878236622,
   "children": [
    -508710747
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’ll be back once I find something.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-508710747": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1952301977,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Good. Try not to contaminate anything on your way out.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Exit"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-30162937": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1962772180,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Every second I’m in this tank, she learns more about how to hurt people.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-784494870": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1962772180,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Careful. If her sensors pick you up, we’re both dead.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "335086328": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1962772180,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Please tell me you’ve got something useful.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1955835827": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1962772180,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Good, you came back. I was starting to think you bailed.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1498639019": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -246076224,
   "children": [
    -1147307735,
    668517938,
    -1964722279
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What’s Evelyn really doing down here?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1666425154": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -246076224,
   "children": [
    -1388295414,
    705867278
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "How can I open your cell?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1388295414": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1666425154,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I don’t know. She locked this chamber herself.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1147307735": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1498639019,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "What hasn’t she done? She said she needed my “samples” for cross-species compatibility.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "926712237": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -246076224,
   "children": [
    1597417010,
    -2028674808
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "How long have you been here?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1597417010": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 926712237,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Six months, maybe more. She keeps me sedated half the time so I can’t track the days. Wakes me when she wants data, puts me back under when she’s bored.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "668517938": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1498639019,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "She meant sperm extraction... daily, mechanical, clinical. She called it “preserving human virility for testing.”",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1832724729": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -246076224,
   "children": [
    573731487,
    1652226999,
    277674852
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why shouldn’t I just call the cops?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "573731487": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1832724729,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Are you insane? You think the cops would even make it through the front door?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1652226999": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1832724729,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And if they did come, she’d wipe this whole place clean before they even parked their car.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1964722279": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1498639019,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "She talks like a scientist while milking people like cattle. I’d laugh if it didn’t make me sick.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "muraquestions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "705867278": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1666425154,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "The interface next to me’s just a monitor; I can’t access anything from inside. Try the console over there. Near the cryo units. If anything can crack this cage, it’s that.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "muraquestions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2028674808": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 926712237,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s like being trapped in a fucking nightmare.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "muraquestions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1109867403": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -246076224,
   "children": [
    1982688197
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That's all for now.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1982688197": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1109867403,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Good. Be careful, I count on you.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Exit"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "277674852": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1832724729,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You’d end up arrested for trespassing while she quietly relocates everything to another warehouse. No cops. No headlines.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "muraquestions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
